# A timer that survives a save: a street lamp's keeper
# (`core:lamp_keeper`, a recurring rule attached as the lamp is made)
# lights it at dusk and puts it out at dawn. The runner saves and loads
# between lines, so the keeper's timer and its place in its schedule
# must come through a save unchanged (05 §9.4, §13.4).
use default seed=6
gen core:testland size=1
spawn device at @c:20,20,0 tag=street_lamp as=lamp
advance 1h
assert "not @lamp.var('core:lit')"
advance 615min
assert "@lamp.var('core:lit')"
advance 12h
assert "not @lamp.var('core:lit')"
expect hash 12f2c79ea8debd3904eff404af3c8d22
